			"notes": "> [!NOTE]\n> This is (hopefully) the last Trident version that will be released for 1.21.11. Going forwards, all new Trident releases will be made exclusively for 26.1.2. While the same was said for the last release, there were a few critical bugs that needed to be fixed.\n\n## ✨ What’s New?\n\n- **Wayfinder Module**\n    - Improved the visuals of the module by adding a progress bar to each grotto.\n\n- **Enhanced Compact Infinibag**\n    - Added an option to disable the black background behind the text.\n\n## 🐛 Bug fixes and Misc.\n\n- Fix compact infinibag display overflowing numbers greater than 10K (#71) by @29cmb\n- Updated the pin icon in Chatroom Lock (made by Koivas)\n- Fixed an issue that made wayfinder module not disabling when it should\n- Fixed an issue that caused quest lock to be disabled when Island Utils is installed\n- Fixed an issue where Discord RPC was showing up when being disabled\n- Fixed stacked augments showing incorrect durability\n\n## New Contributors\n* @29cmb made their first contribution in https://github.com/pe3ep/Trident/pull/72\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pe3ep/Trident/compare/1.3.0...1.3.1"
		},
