			"notes": "0.0.3-Alpha: 1.21.8 and 2 new features!\n---\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> With this release Trident no longer supports Minecraft versions below 1.21.8\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Due to the design overhaul, Borderless theme no longer exists. If you are updating, make sure to reset your theme to default, otherwise the game will crash.\n\n- **Updated** to 1.21.8\n- **Fixed** Spirit Magnet not showing up in the Supplies Module\n- **Fixed** Stock Replenisher augment causing issues with Depleted Display\n- **Overhauled the design**, making the modules be more rounded and similar to MCC Island's style\n- **Added Blueprint Indicators**\nWhen enabled, shows a small icon near the blueprint that communicates whether its new or maxed its Royal donations\n- **Added Kill Feed**\nWhen enabled shows a kill feed (similar to games like Valorant and Counter Strike)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pe3ep/Trident/compare/0.0.2-Alpha...0.0.3-Alpha"
